    "causal_summary": "cli-jev is the single public skill identity for Jev typed judgments, split out of the cli-external-orchestration family into a hub with one transport packet. The hub routes a judgment request to cli-usage through mode-registry.json and hub-router.json; the transport bridges the jev CLI and MCP surface, returning one typed value (a probability, one option key, an ordered score position, or a batch of keyed answers) while writing nothing into this workspace. Write, Edit and Task are forbidden and mutatesWorkspace is false, so the transport selects while a workflow acts. The advisor sees one hub and resolves the transport by hub membership, because every transport is routingClass metadata.",
